cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite both the accompanying paper and the archived software artifact."
title: "OpenRE-Bench: Issue-mining extension (MSR branch msr2027)"
type: software
version: "msr2027-v1.1"
license: "AGPL-3.0-or-later"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24111289"
repository-code: "https://github.com/haowei614/OpenRE-Bench-Artifact"
url: "https://github.com/haowei614/OpenRE-Bench-Artifact/tree/msr2027"
abstract: >-
  OpenRE-Bench is a replication harness for evaluating multi-agent Requirements
  Engineering frameworks under shared experimental conditions. This MSR-branch
  tip extends the QUARE (RE 2026) artifact with a GitHub issue-mining pipeline,
  a published filtered issue pool, a filter audit, five mined cases,
  reference runs on those cases, and a 16-project scale demonstration of the
  mining pipeline. The frozen QUARE release remains tag
  quare-2026 (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20790776).
